<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal" xmlns:amll="http://www.example.com/ns/amll" itunes:timing="Line" xml:lang="en"><head><metadata><amll:meta key="ncmMusicId" value="2156449786"/><amll:meta key="appleMusicId" value="1740461039"/><amll:meta key="musicName" value="I I I"/><amll:meta key="artists" value="宝鐘マリン / Kobo Kanaeru"/><amll:meta key="album" value="I I I"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithub" value="149807805"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithubLogin" value="Ma-hiru"/></metadata></head><body dur="03:03.690"><div begin="00:00.800" end="03:03.690"><p begin="00:00.800" end="00:02.170" itunes:key="L1">はーい注目<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">好ー的 都看过来</span></p><p begin="00:02.170" end="00:04.290" itunes:key="L2">まあ いっちょ踊ってこうか？<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">要不要来跟我共舞一曲呢？</span></p><p begin="00:04.290" end="00:06.910" itunes:key="L3">視線牛耳ってんのは<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">主宰众人视线的是I I I</span></p><p begin="00:06.910" end="00:07.970" itunes:key="L4">I I I<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我我我</span></p><p begin="00:07.970" end="00:08.710" itunes:key="L5">あれ？<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">奇怪？听你们的声音</span></p><p begin="00:08.710" end="00:09.550" itunes:key="L6">君たちの声<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">其实依然觉得不曾尽兴吧？</span></p><p begin="00:09.550" end="00:11.540" itunes:key="L7">まだ足りてないんじゃないの？</p><p begin="00:11.540" end="00:13.150" itunes:key="L8">Our night's just begun<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我们的夜晚才刚刚开始</span></p><p begin="00:13.150" end="00:15.470" itunes:key="L9">Aye, let's blast it!<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">让我们尽情狂欢</span></p><p begin="00:15.470" end="00:18.170" itunes:key="L10">赤く火照る face<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">脸颊火热通红</span></p><p begin="00:18.170" end="00:21.640" itunes:key="L11">ヒートアップしちゃって絡む sweat<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">气氛愈发高涨 汗水淋漓交织</span></p><p begin="00:21.640" end="00:23.970" itunes:key="L12">渇いた喉潤す<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">滋润干渴喉咙的</span></p><p begin="00:23.970" end="00:25.770" itunes:key="L13">オアシスよマリンブルー<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">那片绿洲 蓝色海洋</span></p><p begin="00:25.770" end="00:27.580" itunes:key="L14">あっはーん！<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">啊哈</span></p><p begin="00:27.580" end="00:28.840" itunes:key="L15">たまらないんでしょ？<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">令人欲罢不能吧？</span></p><p begin="00:28.840" end="00:29.530" itunes:key="L16">（ばっきゅん）<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">(正中内心)</span></p><p begin="00:29.530" end="00:30.880" itunes:key="L17">From shore to shore<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">辗转于各个海岸</span></p><p begin="00:30.880" end="00:32.660" itunes:key="L18">My moves bring the storm to the floor<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我的一举一动将在舞池里掀起风暴</span></p><p begin="00:32.660" end="00:34.620" itunes:key="L19">Thunder rays blast a sonic boom<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">雷电轰鸣 发出巨响</span></p><p begin="00:34.620" end="00:36.870" itunes:key="L20">I ride the beat like I'm surfing shock waves<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我自如驾驭节奏 如同冲浪带来的冲击波</span></p><p begin="00:36.870" end="00:38.420" itunes:key="L21">Ah, don't need no sunblock<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">不需要涂防晒霜</span></p><p begin="00:38.420" end="00:40.260" itunes:key="L22">I can make it rain 'cause you hit the jackpot<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我可以让甘霖从天而降 因为你中了头奖</span></p><p begin="00:40.260" end="00:41.610" itunes:key="L23">Baby (oh baby), get ready<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">宝贝 做好准备</span></p><p begin="00:41.610" end="00:43.970" itunes:key="L24">If you wanna ride on with the OGs<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">如果你想跟大神们一起驾驭全场</span></p><p begin="00:43.970" end="00:46.740" itunes:key="L25">アーゥチチな二人はだぁれ？<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">那无比火辣的两人究竟是谁？</span></p><p begin="00:46.740" end="00:47.460" itunes:key="L26">(Yeah baby)<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">高举双手 纵情投入</span></p><p begin="00:47.460" end="00:50.360" itunes:key="L27">Hands up ぶち上げたまえ！</p><p begin="00:50.360" end="00:50.910" itunes:key="L28">(Oh baby)<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">让人有种头晕目眩的感觉</span></p><p begin="00:50.910" end="00:52.990" itunes:key="L29">クラッときちゃう様な</p><p begin="00:52.990" end="00:54.530" itunes:key="L30">熱が足りない<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">还是不够火热</span></p><p begin="00:54.530" end="00:56.120" itunes:key="L31">Our night's just begun<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我们的夜晚才刚刚开始</span></p><p begin="00:56.120" end="00:58.270" itunes:key="L32">Aye, let's blast it!<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">让我们尽情狂欢</span></p><p begin="00:58.270" end="01:01.020" itunes:key="L33">ハジけて派手にいったーれ！<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">无需顾忌尽情地释放自我吧</span></p><p begin="01:01.020" end="01:01.730" itunes:key="L34">(Yeah baby)<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我们想要狂欢至来世</span></p><p begin="01:01.730" end="01:04.540" itunes:key="L35">来世まで we wanna party</p><p begin="01:04.540" end="01:05.330" itunes:key="L36">(Oh baby)<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">视线都聚焦于我</span></p><p begin="01:05.330" end="01:07.090" itunes:key="L37">All eyes on me</p><p begin="01:07.090" end="01:08.890" itunes:key="L38">I can taste the high<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我能品味到那份快感</span></p><p begin="01:08.890" end="01:12.490" itunes:key="L39">Aye まだまだ沸いてこうぜ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">还要继续将气氛炒热吧</span></p><p begin="01:12.490" end="01:13.760" itunes:key="L40">はーい注目<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">好ー的 都看过来</span></p><p begin="01:13.760" end="01:15.960" itunes:key="L41">まあ いっちょ踊ってこうか？<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">要不要来跟我共舞一曲呢？</span></p><p begin="01:15.960" end="01:18.630" itunes:key="L42">視線牛耳ってんのは<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">主宰众人视线的是I I I</span></p><p begin="01:18.630" end="01:22.940" itunes:key="L43">I I I<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我我我</span></p><p begin="01:22.940" end="01:25.040" itunes:key="L44">Ah よそ見しちゃやーん（やーん）<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">可不要左顾右盼</span></p><p begin="01:25.040" end="01:26.620" itunes:key="L45">マリンが bestest girl じゃん？<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">玛琳不就是魅力四射的女孩？</span></p><p begin="01:26.620" end="01:28.470" itunes:key="L46">砂の数よりも魅力がある<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">魅力如尘沙般数不胜数</span></p><p begin="01:28.470" end="01:29.080" itunes:key="L47">キミたちもう<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">呐 就连你们也会臣服于我吧？</span></p><p begin="01:29.080" end="01:30.100" itunes:key="L48">ねぇ 虜でしょ？<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">哈？谁说这是跟年龄挂钩的？</span></p><p begin="01:30.100" end="01:31.840" itunes:key="L49">は？年の数程って誰か言った？<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">刚刚有谁说了与年龄相当</span></p><p begin="01:31.840" end="01:33.200" itunes:key="L50">（うふん）大人の魅力よ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">嗯哼 这是大人的魅力哦</span></p><p begin="01:33.200" end="01:34.070" itunes:key="L51">っておいゴラァ！<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">喂 你们这些家伙</span></p><p begin="01:34.070" end="01:35.060" itunes:key="L52">マリンは17たい<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">玛琳才17岁啦</span></p><p begin="01:35.060" end="01:35.870" itunes:key="L53">っておい聞けや！<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">喂 给我听好</span></p><p begin="01:35.870" end="01:37.170" itunes:key="L54">我慢の限界かな<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">要忍到极限了吧</span></p><p begin="01:37.170" end="01:37.930" itunes:key="L55">とかって きゃ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">什么啦 呀</span></p><p begin="01:37.930" end="01:41.600" itunes:key="L56">Bring in the heat that can't be splashed away (hey, yeah)<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">带来那份永远都无法浇熄的热情</span></p><p begin="01:41.600" end="01:44.030" itunes:key="L57">Fishing a big catch, the stardom I deserve<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">满载而归 得到属于我的荣耀</span></p><p begin="01:44.030" end="01:45.400" itunes:key="L58">But I'm just chilling<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">但我不过在悠哉地</span></p><p begin="01:45.400" end="01:47.220" itunes:key="L59">A mocktail Mai-Tai, sipping<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">喝着无酒精的鸡尾酒</span></p><p begin="01:47.220" end="01:49.940" itunes:key="L60">'Cause I got that juice<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">因为我还有果汁</span></p><p begin="01:49.940" end="01:52.340" itunes:key="L61">Might let you have a taste<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">或许会让你来品尝</span></p><p begin="01:52.340" end="01:54.040" itunes:key="L62">みてこの body<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">快看这具身体 这就是我的财富吧 甜心</span></p><p begin="01:54.040" end="01:55.710" itunes:key="L63">Money でしょ honey<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">宛如价值连城对吧honey</span></p><p begin="01:55.710" end="01:57.760" itunes:key="L64">秘宝な素肌ね<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">如同秘宝般的光滑肌肤</span></p><p begin="01:57.760" end="01:59.280" itunes:key="L65">やん！見ないで 待って<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">不要盯着看 等一下</span></p><p begin="01:59.280" end="02:01.160" itunes:key="L66">Beside a bonfire<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">在篝火旁</span></p><p begin="02:01.160" end="02:04.190" itunes:key="L67">Our luring smoke takes you higher<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我们诱人的烟雾将让你觉得更嗨</span></p><p begin="02:04.190" end="02:09.680" itunes:key="L68">ね？We drive you crazy<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">呐？我们会让你深陷疯狂</span></p><p begin="02:09.680" end="02:11.850" itunes:key="L69">Ahoy</p><p begin="02:11.850" end="02:13.880" itunes:key="L70">熱苦しくなってこう<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">变得酷热难耐吧</span></p><p begin="02:13.880" end="02:15.650" itunes:key="L71">もうどうしようもない<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">感觉已经无可救药了</span></p><p begin="02:15.650" end="02:16.920" itunes:key="L72">My bright spotlight<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我耀眼的聚光灯</span></p><p begin="02:16.920" end="02:19.820" itunes:key="L73">どんどん新境地イっちゃいそ？<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">开始渐渐地步入新境地了吧？</span></p><p begin="02:19.820" end="02:20.680" itunes:key="L74">(Oh baby)<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">那无比火辣的两人究竟是谁？</span></p><p begin="02:20.680" end="02:23.570" itunes:key="L75">アーゥチチな二人はだぁれ？</p><p begin="02:23.570" end="02:24.140" itunes:key="L76">(Yeah baby)<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">高举双手 纵情投入</span></p><p begin="02:24.140" end="02:27.060" itunes:key="L77">Hands up ぶち上げたまえ！</p><p begin="02:27.060" end="02:27.650" itunes:key="L78">(Oh baby)<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">让人有种头晕目眩的感觉</span></p><p begin="02:27.650" end="02:29.740" itunes:key="L79">クラッときちゃう様な</p><p begin="02:29.740" end="02:31.200" itunes:key="L80">熱が足りない<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">还是不够火热</span></p><p begin="02:31.200" end="02:32.870" itunes:key="L81">Our night's just begun<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我们的夜晚才刚刚开始</span></p><p begin="02:32.870" end="02:34.910" itunes:key="L82">Aye, let's blast it!<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">让我们尽情狂欢</span></p><p begin="02:34.910" end="02:37.770" itunes:key="L83">ハジけて派手にいったーれ！<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">无需顾忌尽情地释放自我吧</span></p><p begin="02:37.770" end="02:38.430" itunes:key="L84">(Yeah baby)<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我们想要狂欢至来世</span></p><p begin="02:38.430" end="02:41.390" itunes:key="L85">来世まで we wanna party</p><p begin="02:41.390" end="02:41.910" itunes:key="L86">(Oh baby)<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">视线都聚焦于我</span></p><p begin="02:41.910" end="02:43.740" itunes:key="L87">All eyes on me</p><p begin="02:43.740" end="02:45.620" itunes:key="L88">I can taste the high<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我能品味到那份快感</span></p><p begin="02:45.620" end="02:49.210" itunes:key="L89">Aye まだまだ沸いてこうぜ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">还要继续将气氛炒热吧</span></p><p begin="02:49.210" end="02:50.460" itunes:key="L90">はーい注目<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">好ー的 都看过来</span></p><p begin="02:50.460" end="02:52.660" itunes:key="L91">まあ いっちょ踊ってこうか？<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">要不要来跟我共舞一曲呢？</span></p><p begin="02:52.660" end="02:54.750" itunes:key="L92">視線牛耳ってんのは<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">主宰众人视线的是</span></p><p begin="02:54.750" end="02:55.210" itunes:key="L93">Bring it back<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">重返之前</span></p><p begin="02:55.210" end="02:55.770" itunes:key="L94">Let's hit it<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">让我们最后再来一次</span></p><p begin="02:55.770" end="02:56.330" itunes:key="L95">One last time!<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我们真的是最强的存在吧？</span></p><p begin="02:56.330" end="02:57.900" itunes:key="L96">アタシたち</p><p begin="02:57.900" end="02:59.930" itunes:key="L97">マジで最強じゃん？</p><p begin="02:59.930" end="03:02.020" itunes:key="L98">Just two besties so fly!<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我们关系亲密 尽情飞扬</span></p><p begin="03:02.020" end="03:02.470" itunes:key="L99">(Giga)<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">Ah ahah</span></p><p begin="03:02.470" end="03:03.690" itunes:key="L100">Ah-ah-ah</p></div></body></tt>